{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-08-26 16:30:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF MIDIGATOR', 'text': 'ACQUISITION FURTHER EXPANDS EQUIFAX GLOBAL FOOTPRINT IN DIGITAL IDENTITY AND FRAUD PREVENTION SOLUTIONS ATLANTA , AUG. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF MIDIGATOR LLC , A PROVIDER OF POST-TRANSACTION FRAUD MITIGATION SOLUTIONS. THE DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE MIDIGATOR WAS ANNOUNCED ON JULY 26, 2022.'}